WEBVTT

00:00.111 --> 00:01.012
[SPEAKER_01]: I want your thoughts on this.

00:01.032 --> 00:02.293
[SPEAKER_01]: I think these two are idiots.

00:02.914 --> 00:03.234
[SPEAKER_00]: Totally.

00:03.555 --> 00:03.895
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

00:04.075 --> 00:07.278
[SPEAKER_01]: And you can't figure out which one to beat the shit out of first.

00:07.459 --> 00:10.502
[SPEAKER_01]: Yes, I kind of want to beat the shit out of, but, you know.

00:12.063 --> 00:14.286
[SPEAKER_01]: So, I'm kind of just going to have to let it play out.

00:14.366 --> 00:15.707
[SPEAKER_01]: And I'm not paying him anything.

00:16.028 --> 00:16.228
[SPEAKER_01]: Right.

00:16.328 --> 00:17.789
[SPEAKER_01]: I ain't paying for shit.

00:17.809 --> 00:18.610
[SPEAKER_01]: Never trust me.

00:18.650 --> 00:20.833
[SPEAKER_01]: He's handed it over, but whatever the case...

00:22.028 --> 00:28.151
[SPEAKER_01]: You thought for a second maybe it would be a good thing just to whip up on Leslie and keep pushing on Jude.

00:28.211 --> 00:33.753
[SPEAKER_01]: But then you're like, I don't want Jude to think I would just do that for him.

00:35.894 --> 00:37.935
[SPEAKER_00]: You know what I mean?

00:38.335 --> 00:44.337
[SPEAKER_01]: What I'm trying to say is this conflict between Leslie and Jude is childish.

00:44.958 --> 00:45.758
[SPEAKER_01]: And you're in the middle of it?

00:47.780 --> 00:48.761
[SPEAKER_01]: He owes me.

00:49.901 --> 00:50.382
[SPEAKER_01]: Jude does.

00:50.802 --> 00:51.843
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, Leslie does.

00:51.863 --> 00:52.243
[SPEAKER_01]: Jude does.

00:52.503 --> 00:52.743
[SPEAKER_01]: Right.

00:54.484 --> 00:58.167
[SPEAKER_01]: But letting Jude kill Leslie may not have been the worst thing.

00:58.287 --> 00:58.487
[SPEAKER_01]: No.

00:58.607 --> 01:01.248
[SPEAKER_01]: In fact, I would have been fun with it either way to be honest.

01:01.348 --> 01:06.712
[SPEAKER_01]: I considered just walking out of the room and going up to do something else.

01:09.197 --> 01:11.878
[SPEAKER_00]: This is not making any progress.

01:11.958 --> 01:15.759
[SPEAKER_01]: Even though the truth is that June is focused on getting information.

01:15.779 --> 01:21.061
[SPEAKER_01]: This is just putting me in the middle of it that I don't want to be in.

